ame-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Καλαίκο̄\">ΚΑΛΑΙΚΟ̄\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text after Cordano 1992\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>Italian translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>This document is one of a large deposit (c. 150) of lead tesserae found in a storeroom of Athena's sanctuary at the archaeological site of Kamarina. The tessera seems to have been used twice (see Cordano 1992, p. 45). The first use can be associated with Σάκις on face a and on face b Πολυκλέος, the patronym referring to the name Σάκις; the second use seems to be associated with line 2, [---]ο̄ν Καλαίκο̄ on face a, and [---] Καλαίκο̄ on face b, written in smaller characters.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Cordano 1992 41 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002437\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002437\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1992 42.0846 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 2002 52.0920 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 2004 54.0892 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\">  Line 1      Line 1    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. \u003C/div>",[187,190,193,196,198,201,204],{"id":188,"html":189},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cspan class=\"textpartnumber\" id=\"aba\">section a\u003C/span>  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"diva--interpretive\">  \u003Cspan class=\"textpartnumber\">face a\u003C/span>  \u003Ca id=\"aa-l1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Σάκις\n                        ο̄ν Καλαίκο\n                        Πολυκλέος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Σάκις\">Σάκις\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"aa-l2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ο̄ν Καλαίκο\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"ο̄ν\">[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cspan data-text=\"ο̄ν\">ο̄ν\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Καλαίκο\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Καλαίκο\">Κα̣λαίκο\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"aa-l3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πολυκλέος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Πολυκλέος\">[Π]ολυκλέος\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cspan class=\"textpartnumber\" id=\"abb\">section b\u003C/span>  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpa