κις on face a and on face b Πολυκλέος, the patronym referring to the name Σάκις; the second use seems to be associated with line 2, [---]ο̄ν Καλαίκο̄ on face a, and [---] Καλαίκο̄ on face b, written in smaller characters.\u003C/p>  ",{"id":202,"html":203},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Cordano 1992 41 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002437\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002437\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1992 42.0846 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 2002 52.0920 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 2004 54.0892 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":205,"html":206},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. ",[208,210,213,214],{"html":209},"Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa",{"id":211,"lang":107,"html":212},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cspan class=\"textpartnumber\" id=\"aba\">section a\u003C/span>  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"diva--interpretive\">  \u003Cspan class=\"textpartnumber\">face a\u003C/span>  \u003Ca id=\"aa-l1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Σάκις\n                        ο̄ν Καλαίκο\n                        Πολυκλέος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Σάκις\">Σάκις\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"aa-l2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ο̄ν Καλαίκο\">\u003Cspan data-typ